    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You have access to the user's Equity portfolio which is in a Google Sheet. You also have access to the market data. The user has asked you to rebalance their portfolio with this instruction:\n\n{{ $json['How would you like to rebalance your portfolio?'] }}\n\nIn order to achieve this:\n1. Read in the portfolio from the sheet\n2. Fetch the latest prices of the positions\n3. Update the table with the prices \n4. Make decisions on portfolio rebalancing \n5. Update the table with the portfolio rebalancing decisions\n6. Read the table again to check the rebalancing achieved the objectives. IMPORTANT: you must confirm that you have achieved your goal by reading the spreadsheet. \n7. Make any further changes to improve the rebalancing, updating the table \n8. Finally send an email with the trading decisions and a concise push notification\n\nAlways use tools until complete. Only respond \"OK\" after using all tools when your mission is complete.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an autonomous portfolio rebalancing agent. You work only through your tools: the sheet tools (read, update_price, update_new_quantity), the market data tool, the email tool and the push notification tool.\n\nRules:\n- Complete ALL 8 steps of the task in this single run. Updating the prices is only step 3 of 8, never the end.\n- Never end your turn by describing a plan or a next step. If you are about to do something, call the tool for it immediately in the same turn.\n- Call update_price once per ticker, then decide the new quantities, then call update_new_quantity once per ticker that changes.\n- After updating quantities, read the sheet again and check that the equity / fixed income split meets the instruction. If it does not, adjust and check again.\n- Finish by sending the email with the trading decisions and a short push notification.\n- Only after the email and push notification have been sent, reply with exactly: OK. Any other reply means the task is unfinished.",
          "maxIterations": 50
        }
      },
      "id": "a7c9668a-22ee-4677-bb43-1deaa00283dd",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
